# No em dashes

Never use an em dash (—) anywhere in this project: UI copy, titles, meta tags, comments, or commit messages.

Use a comma, period, colon, or hyphen instead.
- Wrong: `I ship software on my own — scoping features`
- Right: `I ship software on my own, scoping features`
- Wrong: `Alec Campana — Frontend`
- Right: `Alec Campana: Frontend`
